        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You have a slender, eel-like body with azure scales. Your wings sweep along your body like massive fins, making you well suited for watery terrain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
